OL,3,GNEWSAHow Brummies can watch the Ozzy
OL,4,Afilm first
OL,5,
OL,6,FOzzy Osbourne fans living in Birmingham
OL,7,Fwill be able to watch screenings of his
OL,8,Ffinal concert before anyone else.
OL,10,FThe Ozzy Osbourne and Black Sabbath
OL,11,FBack to the Beginning show drew in
OL,12,Fhundreds of thousands of rock fans to
OL,13,FVilla Park last summer, just days
OL,14,Fbefore his death.
OL,16,FAnyone who missed the gig, or wanted to
OL,17,Frelive it, will get the chance to watch
OL,18,Fit in cinemas on 28 October as
OL,19,Fscreenings take place across the UK.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
