OL,3,GNEWSAHow Brummies can watch the Ozzy
OL,4,Afilm first
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut people who live in Birmingham will
OL,7,Fbe able to watch the film one day
OL,8,Fearlier, thanks to the Osbourne family
OL,9,Fwho gave permission.
